#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:7
msgid ""
"Anyone can create public channels, private channels, direct messages, and"
" group messages unless the system admin has :doc:`restricted permissions "
"to do so using advanced permissions </administration-guide/onboard"
"/advanced-permissions>`. Enterprise system administrators can also "
"configure channels as :ref:`read-only <administration-guide/onboard"
"/advanced-permissions:read-only channels>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:13
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:47
msgid "Create a public or private channel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:15
msgid ""
"Select the **Add channels** button in the channel sidebar, then select "
"**Create New Channel**. Alternatively, you can select |plus| at the top "
"of the channel sidebar, then select **Create New Channel**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:31
msgid "The Plus icon provides access to channel and direct message functionality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:17
msgid "You can create a channel using the Add channels button"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:21
msgid "Enter a channel name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:22
msgid ""
"Choose whether this is a public or private channel. See the :doc:`channel"
" types </end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types>` documentation to "
"learn more about public and private channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:23
msgid ""
"(Optional) Describe the channel's focus or purpose. This text is visible "
"to all channel members in the channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:24
msgid ""
"(Optional) Assign the channel to a category. If your system admin has "
"enabled :ref:`channel category sorting <administration-guide/configure"
"/experimental-configuration-settings:enable channel category sorting>`, "
"you can assign the new channel to a new or existing channel category. If "
"this option isn't available, you can `customize your channel sidebar "
"</end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-channel-sidebar>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:27
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:61
msgid "Start a direct or group message"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select the |plus| next to the **Direct Messages** category in the channel"
" sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:31
msgid "Access recent direct messages and group messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:34
msgid ""
"Select up to seven users by searching or browsing. If your organization "
"uses :doc:`connected workspaces </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>`, you can also select remote users from shared channels for "
"direct and group messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:38
msgid ""
"Alternatively, select |plus| at the top of the channel sidebar, then "
"select **Open a Direct Message**. In the **Direct Messages** list, you'll"
" see your most recent conversations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:39
msgid ""
"To add more people to the conversation select the channel name, then "
"select **Add Members**. Adding members to a group message creates a new "
"channel and starts a new conversation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can't remove members of a group message; however, you can start a new"
" group channel and conversation with different members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:41
msgid ""
"If you want to add more than 7 users to a group message, create a private"
" channel instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:49
msgid ""
"Tap |plus| in the top right corner of the app, then select **Create New "
"Channel**. Channels are created as public by default. If you want to "
"create a private channel, tap the **Make Private** option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:52
msgid "You can create a new channel by tapping the plus in the top right corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:56
msgid "You can make a channel private by tapping the Make Private option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:63
msgid ""
"Tap |plus| in the top right corner of the app, then select **Open a "
"Direct Message**. You can select one person for a direct message or up to"
" seven people for a group message. If your organization uses "
":doc:`connected workspaces </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>`, remote users from shared channels are also available to "
"select. Tap **Start** to start the conversation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:65
msgid ""
"You can start a direct or group message by tapping the plus in the top "
"right corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:69
msgid "You can stat a group conversation by selecting up to 7 members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:74
msgid "Automate with channel actions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:76
msgid ""
"The person who creates a channel automatically becomes the channel admin."
" Channel admins using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app can "
"access **Channel Actions** from the channel name drop-down menu in the "
"center pane to set up automatic actions when users :ref:`join the channel"
" <end-user-guide/collaborate/join-leave-channels:join a channel>` or "
":doc:`post a message </end-user-guide/collaborate/send-messages>` to the "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:78
msgid "Automatic actions include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:80
msgid "Displaying a temporary welcome message for new channel members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:81
msgid ""
"Automatically adding the channel to a :doc:`category in the user's "
"channel sidebar </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-channel-"
"sidebar>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:82
msgid "Prompting to run a playbook based on the contents of a message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/create-channels.rst:84
msgid ""
"The :ref:`collaborative playbooks must be enabled <administration-"
"guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings:collaborative playbooks>` "
"for channel admins to use channel actions."
msgstr ""

